        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KILL THEM ALL AND NEVER STOP!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Blimblau: Kill Them All!</i> is a <strong>retro-style Boomer Shooter FPS</strong> inspired by the classics of the ‘90s. Developed by a single indie dev, it delivers pure fast-paced action, violent combat, and gritty pixelated 2.5D/3D graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll face endless waves of <strong>modified humans</strong>, their origin unknown, coming at you without rest. Blast your way through, tear them apart, and survive the bloodbath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Modes:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode</strong>: uncover, step by step, the mystery behind the modified humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade Mode</strong>: pure mayhem with nonstop enemies and bullets flying everywhere.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready: <strong>there’s only one rule — kill them all.</strong></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KILL THEM ALL AND NEVER STOP!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Blimblau: Kill Them All!</i> is a <strong>retro-style Boomer Shooter FPS</strong> inspired by the classics of the ‘90s. Developed by a single indie dev, it delivers pure fast-paced action, violent combat, and gritty pixelated 2.5D/3D graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll face endless waves of <strong>modified humans</strong>, their origin unknown, coming at you without rest. Blast your way through, tear them apart, and survive the bloodbath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Modes:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode</strong>: uncover, step by step, the mystery behind the modified humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade Mode</strong>: pure mayhem with nonstop enemies and bullets flying everywhere.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready: <strong>there’s only one rule — kill them all.</strong></p>",
